format-on-save = 保存时格式化
# A Fluent block value joins its lines with newlines, which is how this one keeps
# the four-line layout the English literal has. The option names are the setting's
# enum values, shown verbatim in the dropdown, so they stay untranslated.
on-format-the-whole-buffer-off-do-not-format-modifications-format-only-lines-with-unstaged-changes-skips-formatting-when-a-git-diff-or-lsp-range-formatting-is-unavailable-modifications-if-available-same-but-falls-back-to-formatting-the-whole-buffer =
    On：格式化整个缓冲区。
    Off：不格式化。
    Modifications：仅格式化有未暂存更改的行；当 git 差异或 LSP 范围格式化不可用时跳过。
    Modifications If Available：同上，但在不可用时回退为格式化整个缓冲区。
